Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.66,0:01:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？失去控制了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.93,0:01:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍受到很强的冲击失去意识
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:01:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精神感应枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精神感应枪？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:08.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉左手装备的精神感应枪！\N听说到现在为止是无人能敌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:10.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精神感应枪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的斗志越来越高
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.69,0:02:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉这男人…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.22,0:02:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,控制人脑脑波的魔术师塔威奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的实力好好展现给我看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.43,0:02:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:29.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第六话 魔术师的正身！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.81,0:02:44.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么珍要杀凯萨琳还有我？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:53.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦中说自己被水晶人给抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却查不出受洗脑的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂，凯萨琳的情况怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在昏迷中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已用一切手段了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是讽刺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.48,0:03:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易姐妹相见了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:16.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐却开枪打伤妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:18.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事实真残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:20.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去求神保佑凯萨琳的回复
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.69,0:03:24.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真难得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍怎么处置
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.89,0:03:29.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么放着别管
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:31.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果减弱精神感应枪的力量输出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就可以醒来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:38.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定累了，别管她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.01,0:03:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情报贩子宰格想见您
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，带上来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水晶人大人，好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看有没有工作可以吩咐在下的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:00.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.33,0:04:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我找出哥普拉的老巢在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:05.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个叼着雪茄的地球人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.53,0:04:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:09.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:11.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么大的人物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得多叫点帮手来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,价格可能会贵一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行，要照常算
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您真精明
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:24.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:26.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是，谢谢惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:29.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不信任我的能力？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.69,0:04:33.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这是慎重起见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了，我也有我的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:52.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神啊 请您救救您伟大的子民
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉，祈求神明本来就不合我的本性
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯萨琳 就请您保庇了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去睡一觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有没有看到穿红衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叼着雪茄的地球人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有啊，他在镇外残破的教堂里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:33.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人头值七万比多的哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.65,0:05:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说他是哥普拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:38.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对，就是哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:41.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就去干掉他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.49,0:05:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是对方是哥普拉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:46.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么够…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:48.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呆子，哥普拉睡着的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就只是个普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时再一刀解决
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.51,0:05:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七万披索
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们花到死，都用不完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要干
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.09,0:06:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你醒了？我忠实的手下，珍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:14.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来，去杀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来他就躲在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在前面的房间里睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:50.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，我先上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们待会再跟过来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.85,0:07:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉的惨叫？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了！加斯那个家伙成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:16.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加斯在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:17.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才要问你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:22.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三更半夜！你们吵什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:23.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这声音不是加斯…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.73,0:07:25.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入别人房闲还问你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.27,0:07:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会生气的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:34.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们以为现在几点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:41.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…加斯他…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么搞的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是杀人用的猎蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:56.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入人的身体吃人内脏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:08:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是基尔顿的杀人机器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.37,0:08:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要动！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:08.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想用猎蛇杀你的是他们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:14.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍，你帮我看着他们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定是基尔顿派来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是基尔顿的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是赚赏金的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:26.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要杀我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用猎蛇的是别人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.83,0:08:32.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才用右手接枪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我认识的珍是左撇子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是连运动神经都被控制的人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍，猎蛇是你放的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那枪装有电子控制装置
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要拿枪的人不是我就不会发射子弹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.78,0:09:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:21.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把哥普拉干掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊！!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个吵死人的夜晚！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了？哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:37.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍，你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:44.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话，拿我当挡箭牌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，把珍送去医务室
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:48.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.87,0:09:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大是您救了我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先回船准备医疗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大，您是我的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.15,0:10:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪开，烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么无情嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:06.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大您的话我都听
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:14.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说，让我帮帮忙嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.27,0:10:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被你的神勇与功夫所折服了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以请让我跟随老大您吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.54,0:10:22.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我自夸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的情报能力是本镇第一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.51,0:10:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:30.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大！我可以帮你搜集情报！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:32.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，控制珍的是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:36.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.06,0:10:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道格，你说的是真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然，消息最灵通的我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:44.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有我不知道的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.77,0:10:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然如此，只要再增加眼线
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:53.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到直到他的位置为止
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:58.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？魔术师塔威奇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:01.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是同伴告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:04.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说最近水晶人雇用了他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.55,0:11:06.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍就是被他控制…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上查出他的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:11.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.90,0:11:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍的情况很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是道格口中的塔威奇的魔术吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:37.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔威奇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.66,0:12:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚出来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:23.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是情报贩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:25.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是情报贩子的道格
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情报贩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:29.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚来找水晶人的是你朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我生意的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.41,0:12:36.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想干上这一票
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:41.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正好，带我到镇外去吧，做向导吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.69,0:12:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一带的情报贩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都靠基尔顿吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大爷要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:12:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是不法者的聚集场所
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到哥普拉最可能去那种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.57,0:13:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实是哥普拉可能来的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.78,0:13:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.31,0:13:44.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的人差不多都是各怀鬼胎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.25,0:13:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.45,0:13:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问您去后面做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.55,0:13:51.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主人，他说那边是后台
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:55.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里？我只是要送花而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:57.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说送花而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:14:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是后台嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.30,0:14:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此，要去请去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人？!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.11,0:14:18.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:22.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:29.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有看到叫道格的情报贩子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.19,0:14:30.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道格吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他平时是在附近的下水道睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:35.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天一回来就去酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莎琳娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:14.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对这些女人做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是把我的种子移植到她们的脊髓上了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:20.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,种子？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.88,0:15:22.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下她们就会照我的意识行动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.25,0:15:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成我的意识奴隶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:26.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意识奴隶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.65,0:15:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:30.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后种子会发芽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扩展全身，女人就会…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人会怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.53,0:15:37.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.40,0:15:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.61,0:15:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:15:59.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有看到道格吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有，最近都没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你有没有看到魔术师达贝地？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.33,0:16:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好危险的小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:30.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀人了，那个穿红衣服的人杀了舞女
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.65,0:16:34.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他抓去警察局
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对，我是正当防卫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的！捉住他！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:45.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人摸我的话我会起麻疹的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.06,0:16:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊！别在意…别在意…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是打酱油的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:54.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何必杀人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:04.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.78,0:17:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被舞女痛下杀手，很我真不幸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:14.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.69,0:17:15.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想对美女痛下杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.73,0:17:16.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老板！好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道格啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.36,0:17:20.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之先来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次找个更好的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大，我已经查处塔威奇的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好！告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.81,0:17:35.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！舞女都受到塔威奇的控制？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.55,0:17:37.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没看到她们的眼睛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是没有意志的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是植物型的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.42,0:17:45.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,植物人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:46.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把种子移植到别人的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:51.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后控制那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.29,0:17:55.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,种子发芽成长最后那个人会…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会死？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:18:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想快点告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.07,0:18:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔威奇那个混蛋到处害人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在想为民除害…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大，你有在听吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.21,0:18:09.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正讲到精彩的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.85,0:18:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔威奇，你似乎是不太称职啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很认真在做工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你又让哥普拉逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.82,0:18:21.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别急
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在几百人身上下了种子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他只是个时间的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:29.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把事情闹太大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.57,0:18:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方是哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是慎重行事而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已找到哥普拉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题现在才开始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:49.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是，死缠不休
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看了我的绝招你们可别感到震惊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.57,0:19:09.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧！我逃的多快呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.41,0:19:13.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜，自己跑进陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:16.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备纳帕姆炮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没路了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:25.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下就犹如瓮中之鳖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发射！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:31.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么声音！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:37.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纳帕姆炮？他们都疯了！?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.33,0:19:39.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后面也有！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想被烤焦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.09,0:20:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千钧一发
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:05.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再慢一步你就变烤鸭了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.23,0:20:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大，这是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烟囱现象
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烟囱？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纳帕姆炮的高温使空气膨胀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.84,0:20:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我开了个洞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:17.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,膨胀的空气压力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.51,0:20:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和高温的上升气流相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以空气就会急速上升了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:23.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此，老大您真是聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.88,0:20:27.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔威奇那家伙做尽卑鄙的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.83,0:20:38.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,植物根伸到神经系统了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:41.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂，没有医治方法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肌肉、内脏都被缠上了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.73,0:20:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法取出
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这样下去珍会…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.97,0:20:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，凯萨琳也危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.28,0:20:56.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍！凯萨琳！你们姐妹相见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:20:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然只能这样接触…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.82,0:21:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍！姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:12.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯萨琳，我好想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.87,0:21:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐，珍姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.17,0:21:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要哭了，让我看你的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.81,0:21:24.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是珍姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.71,0:21:26.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到你我很高兴！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是，凯萨琳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.81,0:21:30.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:31.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想将我微不足道的生命给你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.75,0:21:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么傻话！?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.65,0:21:41.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是内尔森三姐妹的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.49,0:21:45.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我不是死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:47.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会进入姐姐体内
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起活着！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.77,0:21:51.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯萨琳！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.74,0:21:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉凯萨琳的心脏停了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.37,0:22:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.41,0:22:02.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常遗憾，太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.11,0:22:05.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂！这是什么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.32,0:22:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是妹妹以自己的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.19,0:22:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救回姐姐的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.69,0:22:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍活下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.62,0:22:25.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯萨琳死了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.59,0:22:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔威奇！不可原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.18,0:22:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和塔威奇那个家伙展开战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.61,0:22:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但遇上了麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连瑞蒂也被打的很伤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.35,0:22:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也全靠那样而知道那个家伙的弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.18,0:22:51.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸亏在最后能救回来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:54.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他最后还有奇怪的招数
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.39,0:22:56.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍还想和他决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.96,0:22:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好麻烦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.63,0:23:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一集\N珍的仇恨
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:02.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
